#Temp notes
Below is a continuation of a correctly formatted and detailed `.gitignore` file for a .NET project. This file ensures that temporary files, build results, relevant IDE-specific files, and sensitive configurations are excluded:

```gitignore
# Build Folders
bin/
obj/
out/

# Debug and Release folders
*.log
*.vspscc
*.vssscc

# User-specific files
*.user
*.suo
*.rsuser
*.sln.docstates

# Visual Studio Code
.vscode/
.vscode/settings.json
.cursor/

# Visual Studio
.vs/
*.tfstate

# nuget settings related Network
.aider*
